# `.env*` covers .env.local, .env.production, .env.production.local and every
# other real secret file. `.env.example` is the committed TEMPLATE: it contains
# variable NAMES with empty values only, and is the only way a developer learns
# which secrets the app expects.
.env*
!.env.example
